00:19:41.608 --> 00:19:42.309
I'm also asking that we adjourn

00:19:42.309 --> 00:19:45.309
today's meeting in memory of

00:19:45.512 --> 00:19:46.790
david hartzell, an american

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.790
quaker peace activist

00:19:48.448 --> 00:19:49.182
and district eight resident who

00:19:49.182 --> 00:19:52.252
passed away on MARCH 22nd at

00:19:52.252 --> 00:19:52.952
the age of 84.

00:19:52.952 --> 00:19:55.756
The son of peace movement

00:19:55.756 --> 00:19:56.490
activists david dedicated his

00:19:56.490 --> 00:19:57.240
life to nonviolent peacemaking

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:59.424
from an early age.

00:19:59.894 --> 00:20:00.527
After meeting martin luther

00:20:00.527 --> 00:20:03.397
king jr in 1956, he was

00:20:03.397 --> 00:20:04.640
inspired to join civil rights

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:04.431
and later anti-vietnam war

00:20:04.431 --> 00:20:06.431
movements.

00:20:07.401 --> 00:20:08.680
He participated in the 1960s

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.470
sit ins and contributed to

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:10.704
peacebuilding efforts in kosovo

00:20:10.704 --> 00:20:11.371
.

00:20:11.371 --> 00:20:12.600
For nearly two decades he

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:14.406
worked with the american

00:20:14.408 --> 00:20:14.976
friends service committee

00:20:14.976 --> 00:20:15.643
engaging in nonviolent

00:20:15.643 --> 00:20:18.430
peacemaking in the united

00:20:18.546 --> 00:20:19.213
states the soviet union, mexico

00:20:19.213 --> 00:20:19.980
,the philippines and iran.

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:22.883
>> david later later went on to

00:20:22.883 --> 00:20:23.584
lead the peace workers a

00:20:23.584 --> 00:20:24.184
network of peace activists

00:20:24.184 --> 00:20:26.584
based primarily in san

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:27.254
francisco until his death

00:20:27.254 --> 00:20:29.254
in 2002.

00:20:30.291 --> 00:20:30.992
He joined peace advocates from

00:20:30.992 --> 00:20:31.659
49 countries to officially

00:20:31.659 --> 00:20:33.659
establish nonviolent peace

00:20:34.128 --> 00:20:34.896
force which deployed its first

00:20:34.896 --> 00:20:37.198
civilian protection team to sri

00:20:37.198 --> 00:20:37.965
lanka a year later.

00:20:37.965 --> 00:20:40.965
In 2014 he founded world beyond

00:20:41.135 --> 00:20:41.835
war, an organization that

00:20:41.835 --> 00:20:42.536
pursues the abolition of war

00:20:42.536 --> 00:20:44.536
through regional organizing

00:20:44.838 --> 00:20:45.573
and global campaigns to close

00:20:45.573 --> 00:20:46.307
military bases and divest from

00:20:46.307 --> 00:20:48.707
corporations that profit from

00:20:48.743 --> 00:20:49.244
war rest in peace and power.

00:20:49.244 --> 00:20:51.244
David hartzell.

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:52.947
MAY your memory be a blessing.

