00:21:03.791 --> 00:21:04.393
>> supervisor cheryl colleagues

00:21:04.393 --> 00:21:06.793
tomorrow marks the 83rd

00:21:07.896 --> 00:21:10.665
anniversary of the bataan death

00:21:10.665 --> 00:21:11.233
MARCH on APRIL 9th, 19 42

00:21:11.233 --> 00:21:11.933
during world war two.

00:21:11.933 --> 00:21:14.333
After months of resistance

00:21:14.703 --> 00:21:15.403
in the baton peninsula in the

00:21:15.403 --> 00:21:17.403
philippines, 75,000 filipino

00:21:19.207 --> 00:21:19.874
and american soldiers were

00:21:19.874 --> 00:21:20.474
forced to surrender to the

00:21:20.474 --> 00:21:22.474
imperial japanese army.

00:21:23.345 --> 00:21:24.120
These brave members of the

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:26.412
united states army forces

00:21:26.715 --> 00:21:27.515
in the far east endured 99

00:21:27.515 --> 00:21:30.718
grueling days of combat only to

00:21:30.718 --> 00:21:33.718
be forced upon surrender to

00:21:34.923 --> 00:21:35.657
MARCH over 765 miles in brutal

00:21:35.657 --> 00:21:38.570
conditions with little food,

00:21:39.194 --> 00:21:39.929
medicine or support.

00:21:39.929 --> 00:21:42.498
Thousands perished in what is

00:21:42.498 --> 00:21:42.931
now remembered as the bataan

00:21:42.931 --> 00:21:44.931
death MARCH.

00:21:45.600 --> 00:21:46.301
One of the most harrowing

00:21:46.301 --> 00:21:47.102
atrocities of world war two.

00:21:47.102 --> 00:21:49.338
>> on APRIL 5th my office had

00:21:49.338 --> 00:21:49.971
the privilege of attending the

00:21:49.971 --> 00:21:51.971
annual bataan remembrance

00:21:53.141 --> 00:21:53.875
ceremony remembrance ceremony

00:21:53.875 --> 00:21:54.511
at the san francisco national

00:21:54.511 --> 00:21:56.911
cemetery in the presidio.

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:57.813
Honoring the courage

00:21:57.813 --> 00:21:58.581
and sacrifice of those affected

00:21:58.581 --> 00:22:01.217
by the death MARCH as well as

00:22:01.217 --> 00:22:01.784
the veterans of world war two

00:22:01.784 --> 00:22:04.184
and the korean war.

00:22:05.154 --> 00:22:08.154
>> thank you to cecilia galan

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:09.910
galan excuse me and the baton

00:22:09.910 --> 00:22:09.758
legacy historical society for

00:22:09.758 --> 00:22:12.158
continuing to preserve the

00:22:13.950 --> 00:22:15.932
legacy of filipino and american

00:22:15.932 --> 00:22:16.599
world war two veterans

00:22:16.599 --> 00:22:17.266
and serving as a powerful

00:22:17.266 --> 00:22:19.468
reminder of the deep ties

00:22:19.468 --> 00:22:20.350
between the filipino

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:22.350
and american peoples.

00:22:22.638 --> 00:22:23.272
Both of my grandfathers served

00:22:23.272 --> 00:22:24.730
in world war two and their

00:22:24.730 --> 00:22:26.442
stories have always reminded me

00:22:26.442 --> 00:22:27.209
of the sacrifice and strength

00:22:27.209 --> 00:22:27.976
that defined that generation.

00:22:27.976 --> 00:22:30.713
But I'm also proud to say that

00:22:30.713 --> 00:22:31.313
others on my team have

00:22:31.313 --> 00:22:31.981
grandparents who served

00:22:31.981 --> 00:22:34.651
in world war two in various

00:22:34.651 --> 00:22:37.520
capacities including my aide mc

00:22:37.520 --> 00:22:38.254
del rosario, whose grandfather

00:22:38.254 --> 00:22:41.254
artemio was a philippine scout

00:22:41.824 --> 00:22:42.258
and himself endured the bataan

00:22:42.258 --> 00:22:42.958
death MARCH.

00:22:42.958 --> 00:22:45.358
Through this resolution the

00:22:45.427 --> 00:22:46.280
city and county of san

00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:46.729
francisco affirms its

00:22:46.729 --> 00:22:48.964
solidarity with the families

00:22:48.964 --> 00:22:49.666
veterans and communities that

00:22:49.666 --> 00:22:52.660
carry this history forward.

00:22:53.336 --> 00:22:54.700
Let us pledge to ensure this

00:22:54.700 --> 00:22:56.639
legacy of bravery and sacrifice

00:22:56.639 --> 00:22:57.407
never gets forgotten

00:22:57.407 --> 00:22:57.707
and endures for generations to

00:22:57.707 --> 00:22:59.707
come.

00:23:00.243 --> 00:23:00.843
Rest I submit.

